		0x0002,	 $ Descriptor
		4, 1,	$ Data Type, Data Size
		"Enable Alarm Latch #0",
		"",
		"Alarms will latch FAULTED until a 'Latch Reset' command is received\n\nAlarms effected:\n - Input Status (Open wire)\n - Low & High level Alarms\n - Range Alarms\n\nThis is useful in tracking transient or momentary errors.",
